    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW21WU2JcaVjeGBeEy5Qen4i1)_\n\nFollows the ADR README rule: change a decision by superseding it, not rewriting it.\n\n- ADR 0001: status is now `superseded by 0023`, with a short dated update note. The original text is untouched.\n- ADR 0023: status `proposed` to `accepted`, and a new \"Why I chose Stow after all\" section (easier versioning, easier docs, easier Magit, sync problems, untracked files slowing branches in VSCode and SourceGit).\n- `adr/README.org` table statuses updated.\n\nNo CHANGELOG edits (the nightly tidy writes those). Docs only.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi9veRYaJHDNmDU2Csb)_",
